    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646510/extras/c15bc2c7d9a6904672c897b39c297d93.avif?t=1749484978\" width=616 height=72 /></span><strong>A fantasy-styled sexy alchemy RPG!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage of darkness Aisha has been turned into a futanari! Despite her newfound phallus, work's not going to end just because of some changes down below. She still has many new ingredients left to find! Aisha is an alchemist with a very unique specialization... She makes and sells adult merchandise for everyone's sexy needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every use of her new adult products, she releases her special spermagic, which is the key to defeating the dark mage who transformed her into a futa!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Aisha on her alchemist adventures as she battles against the forces of darkness to reclaim her former body!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646510/extras/affd88bd4f416677c519e039d2ab21f4.avif?t=1749484978\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646510/extras/3ad4da140c968b1cbc90107f2e1abe90.avif?t=1749484978\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646510/extras/a3fb2a2abdb3dde4c47933fe16da6edb.avif?t=1749484978\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through diverse environments and mysterious dungeons in search of rare ingredients for Aisha\u2019s crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of alchemy to create powerful tools, potions, and equipment that aid Aisha on her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up through combat and crafting, unlocking new abilities and items to take on tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfit Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and unlock a variety of stylish outfits for Aisha to wear throughout her adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a little boost? The black market lets you get ahead quickly, whether you're stuck or just want to keep the story moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live2D Animation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience beautifully animated character art with expressive movements and reactions brought to life with Live2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
