" ><strong>Alchemy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of alchemy to create powerful tools, potions, and equipment that aid Aisha on her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up through combat and crafting, unlocking new abilities and items to take on tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfit Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and unlock a variety of stylish outfits for Aisha to wear throughout her adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a little boost? The black market lets you get ahead quickly, whether you're stuck or just want to keep the story moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live2D Animation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience beautifully animated character art with expressive movements and reactions brought to life with Live2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
